1.
The taxes which are the subject of the present Convention are:
a. In Austria
i. the Einkommensteuer (income tax);
ii. the Koreperschaftsteuer (corporation tax);
iii. the Beitrag vom Einkommen zur Forderung des Wohnbauesund fur Zwecke des Familienlasten-ausgleiches
(Contribution from income for the promotion of residential building and for the equalisation of family burdens);
(hereinafter referred to as "Austrian tax");
b. In India:
i. the income-tax,
ii. the super-tax and
iii. the surcharge
imposed under the Income-tax Act, 1961 (
43 of 1961
);
(hereinafter referred to as "Indian tax")
